flowchart TD
    ISSUE[file-sharing problem] --> WHY{category}
    WHY -->|file:// crash/hole| CONTENTURI[FileProvider content URI + grant - never file://]
    WHY -->|access denied| GRANT[grant flags / persist SAF permission]
    WHY -->|OOM/ANR| STREAM[stream content URI off-main - Ch 61]
    WHY -->|provider leak| HARDEN[restrict file_paths + validate + minimal grants - Ch 23]
    WHY -->|no permission for shared| SAFMS[use SAF / MediaStore - no broad permission]
